    Converse.Redirect("tu1000_715", $"Once every few nights, meteors will fall like rain. When this happens, items and enemies in the open field will be resurrected.\nPicking up the fallen star pieces will allow {playerName} to use the Slot Machine.\nGet Purple Coins when the patterns line up!");
